usage: capcov features [-h]
                       {example,validate,check,rollup,coverage,map,report,reconcile} ...

positional arguments:
  {example,validate,check,rollup,coverage,map,report,reconcile}
    example             emit the canonical Authentication model as JSON
    validate            structural validity of a feature model, then its tree
    check               is a configuration valid against the model?
    rollup              binary: does coverage roll up to complete?
    coverage            numeric completeness vector rolled up the tree
    map                 project discovered surfaces onto features
    report              the completeness vector as a Markdown or CSV table
                        with Harvey glyphs
    reconcile           derive feature coverage from native outcome evidence

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
